{#
    The caveat rendered under a scoring rule's copy.

    ONE partial, two surfaces: the post-creation rules screen
    (`Scoring:RuleFields`) and the wizard's „Pravidla" step
    (`Competition:CreateWizard`). Both hand it a string taken from their own
    `ruleHints` map, whose wording lives in src/Enum/OvertimeCoverage.php — a
    rule must not read differently depending on which screen offers it.

    hint  string — the sentence to show
#}
<div class="mt-1.5 flex items-start gap-1.5 text-[12px] leading-snug text-white/45">
    <twig:ux:icon name="lucide:info" class="mt-0.5 h-3.5 w-3.5 shrink-0" />
    <span>{{ hint }}</span>
</div>
